DESCRIPTION:Have you ever thought you might like to write a book? You can d
 o it. It's easy. Actually that's a lie. It isn't easy. But that doesn't mea
 n that it's impossible. You just need a little help. Mark Stringer is a com
 edian and published author. But he hasn't just written a book\, he's read a
  lot of books about how to write books. In this show\, Mark talks about the
  tips and tricks he's found that really work. He also talks about the advic
 e that's curiously missing that he had to find out for himself.\nMore info:
  https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/you-can-write-a-book/
